<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-654] Discovery responds to ping even if it is not possible to connect to node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-654</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now it is not possible to connect to node after communication spi received &apos;onContextDestroyed&apos;, but discovery spi after &apos;onContextDestroyed&apos; still responds to ping requests.&lt;br/&gt;
This can break for example logic in GridCacheIoManager.send(ClusterNode node, GridCacheMessage msg, GridIoPolicy plc) and it throws IgniteCheckedException instead of ClusterTopologyCheckedException.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
